{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/446230-demon-born-unique-exposure","id":446230,"title":"Demon born, unique exposure.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-17T11:24:31-07:00","id":446230,"title":"Demon born, unique exposure.","content":"The question that has been in my head has been what if a demon born is conceived, brought to term and periodically visits a location full of energy. For instance the hedge, underworld, shadow or any others. What if the energy seeps in and merges with their demonic nature?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T01:24:02-07:00","id":447374,"title":"","content":"First, let me say that the Other Realms aren't full of energy. In fact, its rather notable that the fae need humans and their dreams/emotions for glamour, spirits need the essence humans generate. <br /> <br /> Now, what would happen to a demon born with prolonged exposure to an otherworld? Same As any other mortal. And chances are they would end up kidnapped and turned changeling, spirit-Claimed, ghosts who steal their body, etc. At best, we might end up justification for a supernatural merit, if they get lucky enough to avoid the dangers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T01:26:14-07:00","id":447376,"title":"","content":"Since demons don't have access to angelic essence, at most I'd let such a demon buy a merit giving them the ability to sense astral, spiritual, or ghostly essence as well as angelic essence.<br /> <br /> Now the hedge? That would have some interesting possibilities. The fae have outside context magic, and even outside context technology. A demon who figures out the principles of contracts? That could be the game changer to make a story hook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}